---
title: "exchange_rate (Current Finance: Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_supply: total_supply == 0?
    q_check_supply --> q_default: total_supply == 0
    q_check_supply --> q_calc: total_supply > 0
    q_default --> [*]: return 1.0
    q_calc --> q_numerator: numerator = cash + borrows - reserves
    q_numerator --> q_denominator: denominator = total_supply
    q_denominator --> [*]: return numerator / denominator

    note right of q_calc
        INV-001: exchange_rate >= 1.0 under normal conditions (interest accrues)
        INV-002: exchange_rate = (cash + debt - cash_reserve) / total_supply
        INV-003: used for deposit (mint ctokens) and withdraw (burn ctokens)
        INV-004: monotonically non-decreasing as interest accrues
    end note
